---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
>
	<p>
		👋 这里是一名普通工业设计师，对新奇的东西充满了好奇心。
		<br><br>
		一个矛盾的人，着迷于规则的打破，又沉溺于打破后的规则。
		<br><br>
		喜爱阅读、摄影、游戏、音乐、绘画等一切富有创造力的活动。
	</p>

	<div class="mbti-section">
		
		<h3 class="mbti-title">
			<a href="https://www.16personalities.com/ch/档案/0f67c69b24a9d" target="_blank">
				逻辑学家 (INTP-A)
			</a>
		</h3>

		<div class="mbti-chart">
			<div class="trait-row">
				<span class="trait-label left">内向 100%</span>
				<div class="progress-track">
					<div class="progress-fill" style="width: 100%;"></div>
				</div>
				<span class="trait-label right">0% 外向</span>
			</div>

			<div class="trait-row">
				<span class="trait-label left">直觉 96%</span>
				<div class="progress-track">
					<div class="progress-fill" style="width: 96%;"></div>
				</div>
				<span class="trait-label right">4% 现实</span>
			</div>

			<div class="trait-row">
				<span class="trait-label left">逻辑 67%</span>
				<div class="progress-track">
					<div class="progress-fill" style="width: 67%;"></div>
				</div>
				<span class="trait-label right">33% 感受</span>
			</div>

			<div class="trait-row">
				<span class="trait-label left">展望 97%</span>
				<div class="progress-track">
					<div class="progress-fill" style="width: 97%;"></div>
				</div>
				<span class="trait-label right">3% 计划</span>
			</div>
			
			<div class="trait-row">
				<span class="trait-label left">坚决 60%</span>
				<div class="progress-track">
					<div class="progress-fill" style="width: 60%;"></div>
				</div>
				<span class="trait-label right">40% 谨慎</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<style>
		.mbti-section {
			position: relative;
			overflow: visible; /* 必须 visible，不然标题会被切掉 */
			
			margin-top: 2rem;
			padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 1rem;
			
			border: 2px solid var(--main-color);
			box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 0 var(--main-color);
			border-radius: 0;
			background-color: #ffffff;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
		}

		/* 暗黑模式适配 */
		:global(html.dark) .mbti-section {
			background-color: #2e2e2e;
		}

		.mbti-title {
			position: absolute;
			top: -1.2rem; /* 骑在边框线上 */
			left:0.8rem;
			
			background-color: #ffffff; /* 遮挡线 */
			padding: 0 0.5rem;
			
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 1.1rem;
			font-weight: bold;
			border: none !important;
			line-height: 1.2;
			z-index: 10;
		}
		
		:global(html.dark) .mbti-title {
			background-color: #2e2e2e;
		}
		
		.mbti-title a {
			text-decoration: none !important;
			color: inherit;
			border: none !important;
		}

		/* === 【关键修改】给图表区域加个上边距，把内容往下推 === */
		.mbti-chart {
			margin-top: 2rem; /* 这里控制离标题的距离，不够可以改成 1.5rem */
		}

		.trait-row {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: space-between;
			margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
		}

		.trait-label {
			flex: 0 0 auto;
			font-weight: bold;
			font-size: 0.8rem;
			color: var(--main-color);
		}
		
		.trait-label.left { width: 70px; text-align: left; }
		.trait-label.right { width: 60px; text-align: right; opacity: 0.6; }

		.progress-track {
			flex: 1;
			height: 10px;
			border: 1px solid var(--main-color);
			background: transparent;
			padding: 1px;
			margin: 0 05px;
		}

		.progress-fill {
			height: 100%;
			background-color: var(--main-color);
			border-radius: 0; 
		}

		@media (max-width: 480px) {
			.trait-label { font-size: 0.75rem; }
			.trait-label.left, .trait-label.right { width: 60px; }
		}
	</style>

</Layout>